flowchart TD
    A([Guest or learner sends POST course-matches with CSRF]) --> B[Validate CourseMatchRequest]
    B --> C{categorySlug exists?}
    C -- No --> E[400 request error]
    C -- Yes --> D[Load PUBLISHED courses from ACTIVE providers]
    D --> F{Any candidates?}
    F -- No --> N[Empty matches with NO_AVAILABLE_COURSES constraint]
    F -- Yes --> G[EligibilityPolicy checks category, level, language and known THB price within budget]
    G --> H{Any eligible?}
    H -- No --> I[Empty matches with sorted rejection counts]
    H -- Yes --> J[Load PUBLISHED review averages for eligible IDs]
    J --> K[Build validated ScoringInput per eligible course]
    K --> L[Run budget, effort and reviewQuality ScoringStrategy]
    L --> M[Mean raw scores, sort descending then ID ascending, take 3]
    M --> O[Map safe catalog response, round score and breakdown to 2 decimals]
    I --> P([200 CourseMatchesResponse])
    N --> P
    O --> P
